<http://purl.org/co/followedBy> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/example> "\n    :author-1 \n        co:followedBy :author-2 , \n                :author-3 .\n    " .
<http://purl.org/co/followedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Given the list (I[1], I[2], ... , I[i-1], I[i], I[i+1], ... , I[n-1], I[n]), the item I[i] is followed by I[i+1], ... , I[n-1] and I[n]."@en .
<http://purl.org/co/followedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The relation between an item and the following item in a list."@en .
<http://purl.org/co/followedBy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
